Adapted ideas (see plan.md §11): isolated tool-less `claude -p` runtime and its help-probe
(gtm/llm.py), "every fact is a row" observations with a governed vocabulary trigger
(gtm/store.py), user-confirmed signal catalog (gtm/catalog.py), SSRF-safe public HTTP client,
website profiler, pattern-first email finding, outbox approval ladder, opt-out keyword handling,
warmup ramp and deliverability checks.

